1036
00:45:59.060 --> 00:45:59.420
Yeah.

1037
00:46:03.980 --> 00:46:04.580
It is.

1038
00:46:07.180 --> 00:46:08.740
It ends so awkward.

1039
00:46:09.020 --> 00:46:10.240
And then Dwight goes, bang, bang, bang.

1040
00:46:12.800 --> 00:46:17.500
Next up, Stanley is going to be presented with the Diabetes Award.

1041
00:46:17.840 --> 00:46:18.180
Mm-hmm.

1042
00:46:18.380 --> 00:46:20.620
And Phyllis has my favorite talking head.

1043
00:46:21.620 --> 00:46:23.160
I love it so much.

1044
00:46:23.300 --> 00:46:28.440
And she's like, you know, I have diabetes, too, but you don't see me making a big deal about it.

1045
00:46:28.780 --> 00:46:30.320
So much Phyllis sass.

1046
00:46:30.520 --> 00:46:31.180
I know.

1047
00:46:31.580 --> 00:46:34.880
It's like they're friends, but there's so much competition there.

1048
00:46:35.320 --> 00:46:37.060
Stanley and Phyllis are frenemies.

1049
00:46:37.220 --> 00:46:38.340
They are true frenemies.

1050
00:46:38.920 --> 00:46:44.280
Well, during all of these awards, in the shooting draft, Michael goes over to check on Dwight.

1051
00:46:44.620 --> 00:46:46.600
And Dwight's really starting to unravel.

1052
00:46:46.920 --> 00:46:48.620
It's also in deleted scenes.

1053
00:46:49.600 --> 00:46:50.700
It's going pretty well.

1054
00:46:52.240 --> 00:46:53.760
Same crap, different Dundies.

1055
00:46:54.800 --> 00:46:56.940
Yeah, D'Angelo's great, but he's a little green.

1056
00:46:57.580 --> 00:46:59.420
I need you to keep an eye on him in the future there.

1057
00:46:59.780 --> 00:47:00.960
You can count on me.

1058
00:47:01.160 --> 00:47:01.720
That's what I do.

1059
00:47:01.780 --> 00:47:02.820
Keep the boss on track.

1060
00:47:02.940 --> 00:47:03.380
Thank you, Dwight.

1061
00:47:04.220 --> 00:47:05.420
Yes, master.

1062
00:47:05.720 --> 00:47:06.920
You're welcome, master.

1063
00:47:07.280 --> 00:47:08.920
Anything for you, master.

1064
00:47:10.060 --> 00:47:12.920
Michael's like, uh, okay.

1065
00:47:13.620 --> 00:47:14.240
Yikes.

1066
00:47:14.620 --> 00:47:14.860
Yeah.

1067
00:47:15.260 --> 00:47:19.320
And then next up, salt in the wound.

1068
00:47:20.000 --> 00:47:24.840
Dwight wins the promising assistant manager award and tosses it right in the trash.

1069
00:47:24.840 --> 00:47:31.280
Yeah, I don't know if you noticed during this scene, at 13 minutes and 17 seconds, Aaron is holding up a cue card.

1070
00:47:31.480 --> 00:47:31.660
Yeah.

1071
00:47:31.940 --> 00:47:40.980
And if you read the cue card, Dwight's last name is spelled S-H-R-U-T-E instead of S-C-H.

1072
00:47:41.700 --> 00:47:41.880
Yeah.

1073
00:47:42.620 --> 00:47:45.520
When this episode aired, fans pointed this out.

1074
00:47:45.880 --> 00:47:47.520
They wanted to know why.

1075
00:47:48.000 --> 00:47:51.940
Well, the reason it was written that way is because that is how it was scripted.

1076
00:47:51.940 --> 00:47:54.140
But it was not intended as a joke.

1077
00:47:54.600 --> 00:47:59.300
You know, Mindy wrote this episode and she revealed that that is how she spells shrewt.

1078
00:47:59.420 --> 00:48:06.360
And this reveal from Mindy began a hilarious, snarky text exchange between Mindy Kaling and Mike Schur.

1079
00:48:06.560 --> 00:48:13.640
Mindy said, I have spelled it shrewt, S-H-R-U-T-E, in every single script I've written since Hot Girl.

1080
00:48:13.880 --> 00:48:15.740
Have I been wrong this whole time?

1081
00:48:16.060 --> 00:48:16.940
That's what she tweeted.

1082
00:48:17.220 --> 00:48:19.580
And Mike Schur wrote back, yes.

1083
00:48:20.200 --> 00:48:23.040
S-C-H-R-U-T-E.

1084
00:48:23.340 --> 00:48:24.160
Don't worry.

1085
00:48:24.380 --> 00:48:27.920
It's not like you've been writing lines for that character since 2004.

1086
00:48:28.540 --> 00:48:29.040
Damn.

1087
00:48:29.560 --> 00:48:33.100
And Mindy wrote back, this is legit mortifying.

1088
00:48:33.440 --> 00:48:37.540
I guess you have a leg up on its spelling because you're in the shrewt clan.

1089
00:48:37.740 --> 00:48:45.700
To which Mike replied, I also have a leg up on it because I saw the way it was spelled in the pilot and then continued to spell it that way.

1090
00:48:46.140 --> 00:48:47.040
Hashtag burn.

1091
00:48:47.600 --> 00:48:51.620
Note to self, do not get in an argument with Mike Schur.

1092
00:48:51.800 --> 00:48:52.420
I know.

1093
00:48:53.140 --> 00:48:54.240
Oh, my Lord.

1094
00:48:54.680 --> 00:48:55.080
Yeah.

1095
00:48:56.300 --> 00:49:00.420
But if you go to 13 minutes, 17 seconds, you can see it right there on the cue card.

1096
00:49:00.620 --> 00:49:04.920
It's funny to me that the people writing the cue card didn't question it in any way.

1097
00:49:05.060 --> 00:49:06.900
They didn't say, hey, Mindy, did you mean this?

1098
00:49:06.900 --> 00:49:07.240
Yeah.

1099
00:49:07.400 --> 00:49:12.480
They just, they're like, they were just like, no, this is what the script says, so I'm going to do it.

1100
00:49:12.780 --> 00:49:16.300
Next up, Erin is going to win cutest redhead in the office.

1101
00:49:16.580 --> 00:49:18.140
And Meredith is pissed off.

1102
00:49:18.260 --> 00:49:20.640
She throws her best mom trophy on the ground.

1103
00:49:20.840 --> 00:49:23.800
She would rather be cutest redhead than a great mom.

1104
00:49:24.520 --> 00:49:24.880
Interesting.

1105
00:49:25.540 --> 00:49:28.240
Erin is going to go up to receive her award.

1106
00:49:28.440 --> 00:49:30.460
She is so genuinely delighted.

1107
00:49:30.460 --> 00:49:32.920
She's never won an award in her life.

1108
00:49:33.220 --> 00:49:33.400
Yeah.

1109
00:49:33.560 --> 00:49:35.840
She says, you know, it's true what they said.

1110
00:49:36.060 --> 00:49:37.820
The Dundies are magical.

1111
00:49:38.560 --> 00:49:44.680
But I don't feel it because, Gabe, I don't think we should be together.

1112
00:49:44.960 --> 00:49:45.100
Yeah.

1113
00:49:45.420 --> 00:49:46.720
She's with the wrong person.

1114
00:49:47.000 --> 00:49:47.260
Oh.

1115
00:49:48.200 --> 00:49:52.160
For her, the awards have become this truth serum.

1116
00:49:52.160 --> 00:49:56.220
And she is going to break up with Gabe in front of everybody.

1117
