I was very curious about this.

1121
00:50:03.420 --> 00:50:04.720
So I went to the shooting draft.

1122
00:50:05.040 --> 00:50:05.140
Okay.

1123
00:50:05.380 --> 00:50:09.660
He's going to respond to Erin's breakup, also on the microphone, publicly.

1124
00:50:10.500 --> 00:50:15.480
And D'Angelo says to him, since you're up here anyway, do you want your Dundie?

1125
00:50:15.640 --> 00:50:17.500
It's the Ichabod Crane Award.

1126
00:50:17.500 --> 00:50:28.610
I don't know if the whole reason they brought him up on stage was for that Dundie joke.

1127
00:50:28.830 --> 00:50:30.170
But then it didn't make it in.

1128
00:50:30.630 --> 00:50:36.490
Things are going to get more awkward rather than less awkward when Michael presents the

1129
00:50:36.490 --> 00:50:40.330
award to D'Angelo for Best Dundie's HoSt.

1130
00:50:41.570 --> 00:50:42.450
Oh, man.

1131
00:50:43.150 --> 00:50:43.850
Poor Dwight.

1132
00:50:44.410 --> 00:50:45.130
I know.

1133
00:50:45.290 --> 00:50:46.590
Dwight is so hurt.

1134
00:50:46.870 --> 00:50:50.790
And then in order to make his speech, D'Angelo has to put on the Walkman.

1135
00:50:50.970 --> 00:50:52.090
And then he's screaming.

1136
00:50:52.090 --> 00:50:54.890
The manager of the restaurant has had it.

1137
00:50:55.290 --> 00:50:58.090
First, Kevin is coloring on the tablecloth.

1138
00:50:58.470 --> 00:51:00.300
Then they talked about STDs.

1139
00:51:00.830 --> 00:51:02.950
And now he's just screaming into the microphone.

1140
00:51:03.490 --> 00:51:03.610
Yeah.

1141
00:51:03.750 --> 00:51:05.250
He's going to throw everyone out.

1142
00:51:05.870 --> 00:51:09.100
The manager was played by Bill Coleus.

1143
00:51:09.810 --> 00:51:14.410
And according to his bio, he has also appeared in The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel, Criminal Minds,

1144
00:51:14.450 --> 00:51:17.050
and over 50 national commercials.

1145
00:51:17.450 --> 00:51:17.810
Wow.

1146
00:51:17.810 --> 00:51:23.690
Yes, he says in his bio that the commercials have allowed him to visit Buenos Aires, hang

1147
00:51:23.690 --> 00:51:26.850
out with James Gandolfini, and get naked on 43rd Street.

1148
00:51:28.290 --> 00:51:29.650
What ad was that?

1149
00:51:29.850 --> 00:51:30.270
Don't know.

1150
00:51:30.350 --> 00:51:31.090
It didn't say.

1151
00:51:31.430 --> 00:51:31.630
Hmm.

1152
00:51:32.150 --> 00:51:34.630
Everyone is now just sort of milling about outside.

1153
00:51:35.650 --> 00:51:37.930
Go to 16 minutes, 50 seconds.

1154
00:51:38.150 --> 00:51:43.230
In the background of Michael's talking head, did anyone else catch that Paul and Rain and

1155
00:51:43.230 --> 00:51:44.170
Will were talking?

1156
00:51:44.550 --> 00:51:48.630
And Rain motions to Will that he has something in the corner of his mouth.

1157
00:51:48.650 --> 00:51:49.930
I don't know if it's food or what.

1158
00:51:50.070 --> 00:51:52.350
And then immediately, Will wipes off his mouth.

1159
00:51:52.750 --> 00:51:54.230
Did anyone catch it?

1160
00:51:54.230 --> 00:51:58.050
How about Justine Wye from San Francisco, California?

1161
00:51:58.310 --> 00:51:59.410
Yes, Justine!

1162
00:51:59.610 --> 00:52:02.790
She wrote in that exact background catch.

1163
00:52:03.150 --> 00:52:08.290
Now Pam is going to approach Michael and suggest that they all grab some ice cream and go back

1164
00:52:08.290 --> 00:52:10.250
to the office and keep the night going.

1165
00:52:10.790 --> 00:52:12.230
And what's in her hand, Jenna?

1166
00:52:12.630 --> 00:52:13.810
It's so weird.

1167
00:52:13.810 --> 00:52:14.870
It's a dundee.

1168
00:52:14.990 --> 00:52:15.210
Yeah.

1169
00:52:15.310 --> 00:52:17.950
Is she carrying Jim's best dad dundee?

1170
00:52:18.090 --> 00:52:18.630
I could not.

1171
00:52:18.770 --> 00:52:20.090
This threw me off.

1172
00:52:20.090 --> 00:52:24.810
This is what made me obsessed with trying to figure out if my memory was wrong.

1173
00:52:24.950 --> 00:52:26.530
And Pam had won a dundee.

1174
00:52:26.650 --> 00:52:30.650
There is no way that Michael Scott didn't give Pam a dundee.

1175
